  skillDescription: "<color=#FFD700>Base (2★):</color> Lashes his tongue at a ground enemy within 2 tiles, drags it to his mouth and swallows it whole: an instant kill, whatever its HP. Targets Tanks first, then Casters, Rushers and Grunts. He can't attack while he digests (Rusher 3s, Grunt 4.5s, Caster 6s, Tank 12s), but gains +15% DEF and +30% max HP (without healing) and keeps blocking.\n<color=#FFD700>1st upgrade (3★):</color> Digestion is 20% faster, and he recovers 4% of his max HP per second while digesting.\n<color=#FFD700>2nd upgrade (4★):</color> One tongue attack swallows up to 3 enemies. They are digested together over the average of their digestion times."
