  intelQuote: "Mlem."
  intelLore: "A squat, slick-skinned scavenger with a tongue far longer than he is. Mlem lets the wave come to him, then swallows whatever looks most dangerous in one wet gulp and sits very still while it settles. He does not chew. He does not apologise."
